<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:32:46.755Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>COPY MEMO 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>COPY MEMO command</keyword>
    <keyword>Memo fields</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">COPY MEMO 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">将当前记录的备注字段内容复制到文件中。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">COPY MEMO &lt;MemoField&gt; TO &lt;FileName&gt; [ADDITIVE] [AS &lt;nCodePage&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;MemoField&gt;<tab />当前工作区中备注字段的名称。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">TO &lt;FileName&gt;<tab />接收备注字段内容的文件名称。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ADDITIVE<tab />如果文件已存在，则将内容追加到文件末尾。如果没有此子句，则会覆盖现有文件。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">AS &lt;nCodePage&gt;<tab />写入文件中的文本的代码页。省略此子句时，文本将不经转换直接写入。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">示例</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example">USE Customers<br/>COPY MEMO Notes TO CustomerNotes.txt<br/>COPY MEMO Notes TO AllNotes.txt ADDITIVE</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibRT" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_REPLACE_FoxPro">REPLACE (FoxPro)</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\M_XSharp_RT_Functions_DbCopyMemo.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">DbCopyMemo()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
